---
description: Require logical Tailwind properties and Arabic typography so RTL never needs mirrored markup.
globs:
  - "src/components/**/*.tsx"
  - "src/components/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Read and follow `docs/ai/rules/06-rtl-logical-properties.md` in full.

Every new or touched component must use logical Tailwind (`ps-`/`pe-`/`ms-`/`me-`/`start-`/`end-`). Never `pl-`/`pr-`/`ml-`/`mr-`/`left-`/`right-`. Arabic text gets `leading-relaxed` or looser (~1.4), never letter-spaced.
